<title>USA: Genl Dynamics set to ax Litton rumor-sources.</title>
<headline>Genl Dynamics set to ax Litton rumor-sources.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Dynamics Corp is set to issue a statement Tuesday afternoon to squelch rumors of a possible merger with Litton Industries Inc, according to sources familiar with the situation.</p>
<p>A General Dynamics spokeswoman confirmed the Falls Church, Va. company intends to issue a statement before the stock market close Tuesady, though it might come later in the day.</p>
<p>She declined to describe the nature of the announcement.</p>
</text>
